{"id":"hormiga","lemma":"hormiga","pos":"noun","rank":4042,"glosses":["ant (insect of the family Formicidae)"],"ipa":"/hoˈɾmi.ɡa/ [hoɾˈmi.ɣ̞a]","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"hormigas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-hormiga.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tenemos hormigas en la cocina.","en":"We have ants in the kitchen.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456721","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"kitchen"}]},{"text":"¿Las hormigas tienen orejas?","en":"Do ants have ears?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443738","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"outer ear","l":"oreja"}]},{"text":"Él intentó librarse de las hormigas.","en":"He tried to get rid of the ants.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38131","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"intentar"},{"g":"to save","l":"librar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Las hormigas tienen una comunidad bien organizada.","en":"Ants have a well-organized society.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77176","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"community"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"organized","l":"organizado"}]},{"text":"Las hormigas trabajan duro todo el verano.","en":"Ants work hard all summer.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},{"g":"hard"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"summer"}]}]}